 enterprise, you have basically worked through the building blocks of minimizing those dependencies.”<br><br>For more on how rewired organizations minimize bottlenecks, accelerate decision-making, and empower cross-functional teams, check out the final installment of our seven-part video series featuring Lamarre and his <em>Rewired</em> coauthors, McKinsey Senior Partners <span style="text-decoration: underline; line-height: 150%; color: rgb(34, 81, 255);"><a href="https://email.mckinsey.com/T/v710000019ecd0a8871a537cb6e96c660f0/e522db2795044a9a0000021ef3a0bcd4/e522db27-9504-4a9a-a3ed-bc6b01c9ec7f?__dU__=v0G4RBKTXg2GsTlMa8YbE0npiPHb7Gzq29ujr-mrJsl6bcn0E30HNSquNCCrd1XNAz&__F__=v0fUYvjHMDjRPMSh3tviDHXIoXcPxvDgUUCCPvXMWoX_0JoZLAZABQFzGdi2cn1iU7KJEa5whIrwYtzM-cxLg6GUvg70MXDUyAwUhHcYwpf61pzsLuXV8nVEkYWSLk_aB5Mjk5JWsib1R2W5zynfaht9wl0JY717r01K7MigX7fZP1Coz5BgG49dgEuLq8_7crc7b3Igof2js1Vx976UEM2C2Aj22TKfuqhxwDrV8KZOg8oYWyIIgWs4IXtWbiumjVtBnAS2bkPHuwVmL7mCcfi0txsZD61A-OwVqVQsmOjRAI_fzorUWOh_EO_n6cV6G8DiXFEBHBmVCxPvsoG3ruAKc16YzWKPsmK-qrj4srALNznmjEYqEUri4FLktZZhOjWU2-DhU2JDReJDbvWHBjGjLZ5ycOdRKmgUVe6kBshNJ_2CQCpVGvWBqQsz5aNPr7bz-gjOS1Kghlr2_N4JKZuo3KdPBkGfYDEol08ejodFGEV_nbirkwnJnZySSzTFZZv2AfFsaqKSo=" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color: rgb(34, 81, 255); font-weight: inherit; background: none; text-decoration: underline;" data-link-id="992f48b068dd11f195f365f4371ebe85">Kate Smaje</a></span> and <span style="text-decoration: underline; line-height: 150%; color: rgb(34, 81, 255);"><a href="https://email.mckinsey.com/T/v710000019ecd0a8871a537cb6e96c660f0/e522db2795044a9a0000021ef3a0bcd5/e522db27-9504-4a9a-a3ed-bc6b01c9ec7f?__dU__=v0G4RBKTXg2GsTlMa8YbE0npiPHb7Gzq29ujr-mrJsl6bcn0E30HNSquNCCrd1XNAz&__F__=v0fUYvjHMDjRPMSh3tviDHXIoXcPxvDgUUCCPvXMWoX_0JoZLAZABQFzGdi2cn1iU7KJEa5whIrwYtzM-cxLg6GQRsp29vqwTAQVwGcUcwHWwrrZ6A8sOcssRCu5P25VRL0lKL5NT6meymaTskNOlQqecDiG5J8uk_PjTzCufFDBkEeccUsXGV6_6Z9haD6Y5bkgdafRPQjl6ZIY7riRSTgEYZvq8d_2vTvifkL97h6_cDy8XLR-c-ApY-yAaDh96MIkFUBdpFaCB8m